                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Google Sans Text,sans-serif' fontsize='12' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>While high-balance clients finished at a higher absolute floor (70.54%), their net lift (3.76%) is statistically identical to the general population. The conversion friction is systemic, not demographic.</run>
